now and can always build a cluster if I end up with more than one
machine. 

This will be used for research purposes (number crunching, LaTeX, email,
WWW server and browser, reading comp.lang.fortran, comp.os.vms,
comp.sys.dec and other relevant newsgroups etc.) and NOT for commercial
purposes, so you can have a good conscience if you give me a good deal. 

