  Are these real RD53's or are they Micropolis 1325/1335 drives? If the
latter, you need to solder a jumper across the empty pads labeled R7 on
the swing-out logic board on the drive. You also need to format the disks
using the Field Service version of the MDM package - the Customer Diag-
nostics version will only format drives which already have intact formats
(duh!).

