Sorry, no, this is internal to the compiler and is not changeable (other than
by editing the compiler source.)  The message is confusing, I admit. 

Few implementations allow more than 256 arguments - you should consider
modifying the code so that fewer arguments are passed.  Perhaps you can use
MODULE variables or COMMON or a derived type.
