From: "H.W. Stockman" <hwstock@swcp.com>
Subject: Real-life benchmark
Date: 1996/11/17
Message-ID: <328F96B6.45F1@swcp.com>
X-Deja-AN: 197103432
content-type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
organization: Southwest Cyberport
