The VAX780 (and maybe the 750) actually had the PDP instruction set
in hardware (as well as the VAX instruction set), so the 
"compatability" mode ran the instructions in hardware and did not 
really use a software emulator.  The more modern Vaxes do not have 
the PDP instruction set.




