Another thing to check: Did you put the 8MB simms where the 4MB simms were,
or did you plug them into the empty slots.  A lot of PC boards expect
the larger simms to be in the first bank. It may be limiting the
second bank to be smaller or equal than the first one, thus making
your 8MB simms look like 4MB ones. Try swapping the 8's and the 4's.




